{"unit_id":"Soren-ABT__dsh-knowledge#card-zh","repo":"Soren-ABT/dsh-knowledge","commit":"a471c0c66cead44d7d565db047205e0af0f8835c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-knowledge 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的知识库与检索插件。它向 DSH 注册知识服务和模型可调用的知识工具，并在侧边栏挂载浏览器管理面板。用户可建立分组知识库，导入文本、文件、目录和网页，按段落与标题切分文档，再用关键词或配置后的向量检索查找内容；搜索结果可继续读取上下文与结构化证据。插件支持 OpenAI 兼容接口、Ollama、本地模型及无向量的词法检索，也提供文档重建索引和本地模型管理。适合需要让模型查询个人或团队资料的 DSH 用户；安装后可先用默认关键词检索，无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/knowledge/index.ts:3336","src/tool-knowledge/index.ts:349","src/ui/client/index.tsx:45"]}
{"unit_id":"Soren-ABT__dsh-knowledge#card-en","repo":"Soren-ABT/dsh-knowledge","commit":"a471c0c66cead44d7d565db047205e0af0f8835c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-knowledge adds a browser panel and model-callable tools to DSH Web. Organize bases, import text, files, directories, and web pages, then chunk and search with lexical or configured vector retrieval and read bounded context. Supports OpenAI-compatible, Ollama, and local models.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/knowledge/index.ts:3336","src/tool-knowledge/index.ts:349","src/ui/client/index.tsx:45"]}
